astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b8q1sMqyyxMQ7kNvwHvxg1P&_nc_oc=Adl0OYQPG11yhDElHSlmBLaVSimLEfTXba7M8FuQ8xp86TtiZELYAwwQOpVqiiVQScc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0KzmECBd7C8prSZvtA43iNpfIRF5YVV2HQD_W6foNew&oe=69A41B73"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVc6IYBALEUQ7kNvwFm9nkW&_nc_oc=Adn5zz8qI4GPc7v3_srzRY-Bm27KS61Hed8p4ZWn_2Uk7rFn0d9Ljk5Hw1qt0KBhiCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfubqpOSkD8eIxWSNhwCdbFQ4UoLtoJvwA95j41dg4W-GA&oe=69A41C16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jMGUB-H5lZ8Q7kNvwGcKm-O&_nc_oc=AdliBfs5_ISgt1wI2SWZ4YYOOM4soHjsL6EKo8QRf1cw55gJRlZ-3EFemmD8pglFrMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfshVyWmqy4TtTM3lJtkAspbtT5zud6QHk7xoRJkJjbvjw&oe=69A43ABD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip